 ## Background
-The NxNxN cube filter for gradient smoothing was described in the context of volume rendering transfer functions and gradient calculation [S2, unofficial]. It is part of a pipeline that calculates gradients using central differences and then smooths them to prevent irregularities [S2, unofficial]. The implementation details, including the potential bug with returning a reference to a local variable, are found in a GitHub repository [S1, unofficial].
